1
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,420
The wedding invitations have been sent out.

2
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,460
Do you want

3
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,760
to ruin the reputation of the Ling family

4
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:47,940
and the Ye family in Yang City?

5
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,280
If the marriage of the Ling family

6
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,980
needs to rely on a girl to maintain,

7
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,860
then we don't need the reputation.

8
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:53,820
How dare you!

9
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,140
Marriage is a serious matter.

10
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:55,960
It's up to the parents

11
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,860
and the matchmaker.

12
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,360
You have no say in it.

13
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,820
I was indeed too rude.

14
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,300
I'll go reflect.

15
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,320
You...

16
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:04,360
You...

17
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,400
Young Marshal,

18
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,140
everything's been arranged.

19
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:25,280
Xueqiu's documents,

20
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,220
school, and property are all set.

21
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,180
Pick her up at the back door tomorrow morning.

22
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,400
Ye Wenbo killed people in the street.

23
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:33,320
I've put him in jail.

24
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,120
OK.

25
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:38,060
Since you decided to send Miss Xueqiu abroad,

26
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:39,900
you've been doing everything by yourself.

27
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,900
Why don't you have a rest?

28
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,700
Forgive me for being so frank.

29
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:50,500
Although the Ye family is not a good match,

30
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,600
why do you

31
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,340
have to send Miss Xueqiu abroad?

32
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,800
Why don't you find another good husband for her?

33
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,520
I want to put an end to her idea.

34
00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:58,800
I did have this intention,

35
00:01:59,820 --> 00:02:01,480
but the Old Madam was too persistent,

36
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,180
so I had to take this approach.

37
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:04,860
Although the Ye family is the Old Madam's maternal family,

38
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,260
the status of women is low.

39
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:07,640
I think if Xueqiu marries into that family,

40
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,760
there could be hidden dangers.

41
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:10,260
Besides,

42
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,820
an eagle that has seen the sky

43
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:15,560
wouldn't be willing to be confined to the backyard

44
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,720
in the backyard?

45
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,280
You let her choose

46
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,040
literature, art, law,

47
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:23,040
and architecture.

48
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,440
Isn't it too much

49
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,840
for a woman?

50
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,220
People think so

51
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,520
because they think

52
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:32,180
a woman's only way out is marriage.

53
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:33,820
Xueqiu wants to learn architecture

54
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:35,840
because she wants to know

55
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,300
can support a large building.

56
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,920
She wants to study law

57
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,760
because she wants to know

58
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,160
how to protect fairness

59
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:43,580
by rules.

60
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:45,240
Men can learn these,

61
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,500
why can't women?

62
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:47,560
I don't want

63
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,880
gender to stop her from seeing a bigger world.

64
00:02:50,220 --> 00:02:52,080
If she doesn't want to get married in the future,

65
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,280
her ability

66
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,860
will be her greatest asset.

67
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:57,980
Compared to relying on others,

68
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,760
the hardships of studying

69
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,720
are nothing.

70
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,280
Xueqiu wants to study abroad.

71
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,080
I've agreed to her.

72
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:15,300
After dinner,

73
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,500
we'll go to the station to see her off.

74
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:17,800
Really?

75
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,840
She can finally get away

76
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,740
from the person she dislikes.

77
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:24,300
Just like you

78
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:25,980
wanted to get rid of me?

79
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:30,660
So,

80
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,140
are you jealous?

81
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,400
You knew we ran away

82
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,200
at that time?

83
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,040
Of course.

84
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,880
Otherwise, how could I find you so fast?

85
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:00,840
This is from the kids in the orphanage.

86
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,900
They asked me to give it to you.

87
00:04:02,540 --> 00:04:03,420
You said

88
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:05,060
people do things for a purpose.

89
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,460
So, Ling Shenxing,

90
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:08,000
why did you build an orphanage?

91
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,440
Of course,

92
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,640
it's for fame and fortune.

93
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,220
The kids at the orphanage said

94
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:19,620
you never show up,

95
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,640
just send things over.

96
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:22,840
Even Abao,

97
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,380
if I hadn't seen your signature,

98
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:25,400
I wouldn't have known

99
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,320
for Abao's medical bills.

100
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,900
I really underestimated you.

101
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,660
You even know about Abao.

102
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,420
Of course.

103
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:36,680
Who do you think I am?

104
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,080
If I hadn't been falsely accused,

105
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:40,100
I would have found Abao long ago.

106
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:42,580
During this time,

107
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,360
I've heard a lot of things.

108
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:46,560
Everyone has their own story,

109
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,300
but the one thing they all agree on is

110
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:49,900
everyone says

111
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:50,980
Commander Ling

112
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,040
and Young Marshal

113
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:54,840
are the pillars of Yang City.

114
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:56,100
With you,

115
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,880
Yang City is safe.

116
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,200
And,

117
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:05,180
I found something interesting.

118
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,320
Close your eyes.

119
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,660
Open them.

120
00:05:25,860 --> 00:05:26,760
Ling Shenxing,

121
00:05:26,940 --> 00:05:27,820
do you like me?

122
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:31,060
My Lady,

123
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:33,080
what if I do?

124
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:45,080
This is my answer.

125
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:55,580
This is...

126
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:56,440
Commander Ling.

127
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,180
Ah.

128
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:59,340
This is my father

129
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,400
and his aide-de-camp.

130
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,480
Is the aide-de-camp missing?

131
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,340
This

132
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:14,160
was found on my father's body.

133
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,420
I've confirmed with Hongxiu.

134
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:19,040
This is the heirloom jade pendant of the Su family,

135
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:21,240
and it's only passed down to the head of the family.

136
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:23,960
So you suspect

137
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,180
my father killed your father?

138
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:26,120
At first, I suspected.

139
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:28,360
But then the Su family was accused of hiding prohibited drugs.

140
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:29,420
It's all too coincidental.

141
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,820
Clearly, someone set this up.

142
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,120
I want to see Hongxiu.

143
00:06:59,060 --> 00:06:59,780
This sachet,

144
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:01,180
is it made just for me,

145
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:02,880
or for many people?

146
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,120
I made several,

147
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,440
but this one

148
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,900
is the most delicate.

149
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:10,800
If you don't like it,

150
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,560
I'll tear it up.

151
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,240
Don't make it for anyone else.

152
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:31,020
We're here.

153
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:40,600
Hongxiu,

154
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,980
I must find out the truth of that night.

155
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,240
Go in.

156
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:49,280
Xiao Wan,

157
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,400
long time no see.

158
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,320
Chu Nanfeng,

159
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:56,680
why is he here?

160
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:58,280
You go in first.

161
00:07:58,580 --> 00:07:59,060
I'm here.

162
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,120
What are you doing?

163
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:12,680
Move inside.

164
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,420
Go back.

165
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:22,220
Hongxiu.

166
00:08:30,140 --> 00:08:31,360
What's your show today?

167
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:31,820
Young Marshal Ling.

168
00:08:32,740 --> 00:08:34,140
Why did you bring Xiao Wan here?

169
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:35,400
Chu Nanfeng.

170
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:37,220
Mind your own business.

171
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:39,500
I know what you're thinking.

172
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,940
You come to the prison with so many people.

173
00:08:43,820 --> 00:08:45,060
I have to come and see

174
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,700
if you're really interrogating the prisoner

175
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,100
or to trick Wan?

176
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:51,640
Ling Shenxing,

177
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:54,020
I've always been tolerant,

178
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,800
but this time,

179
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,680
I won't tolerate it anymore.

180
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,460
Su Muwan,

181
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:02,860
I'm determined to have her.

182
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,320
My lady.

183
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,500
Hongxiu,

184
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,740
you've suffered a lot.

185
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:12,560
Miss.

186
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,840
I'm dirty.

187
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,320
Don't get your clothes dirty.

188
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:18,460
I didn't take care of you well.

189
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,480
When I heard you were in trouble,

190
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:22,220
I was sad.

191
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,140
I didn't expect

192
00:09:23,140 --> 00:09:24,260
that you were safe

193
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,720
and sound.

194
00:09:28,220 --> 00:09:29,380
Don't be sad.

195
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,660
We will all be fine.

196
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,200
Hongxiu,

197
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,760
I can't remember some things before the accident.

198
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,240
Why were you locked up?

199
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,060
At first, it was because

200
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,480
I tried to kill the Third Madame.

201
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:43,060
The Third Madame?

202
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:45,180
Is there a Third Madame in the Ling residence?

203
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:47,320
Yes, there is.

204
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,540
My lady, don't you remember?

205
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,080
The Third Madame's courtyard

206
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,260
is filled with lilacs.

207
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:54,140
I heard that lilac sachets can repel mosquitoes.

208
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,840
When you were marching and fighting,

209
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,580
you often suffered from mosquito bites.

210
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,320
So you ordered me to make a lilac sachet for you.

211
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,600
That day,

212
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,880
I went with you

213
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:05,240
to visit the Third Madame

214
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,200
with the perfume you made.

215
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:07,820
The Third Madame

216
00:10:07,820 --> 00:10:08,740
liked the perfume very much.

217
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:10,680
She immediately poured some on her wrist.

218
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:11,960
But she died

219
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,240
shortly after.

220
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,120
Has this perfume

221
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,580
been handled by anyone else?

222
00:10:18,140 --> 00:10:20,600
I remember the Second Madame's maid smelled it

223
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,100
and praised your skills.

224
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:25,420
Second Madame, I forgot about you.

225
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:26,600
By the way,

226
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:28,960
do you remember who has the Su family's jade pendant?

227
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,440
When you got married,

228
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,500
the Master gave you

229
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:32,460
the jade pendant.

230
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,620
Did I give it to someone else?

231
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:36,060
I'm not sure.

232
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:37,800
[Hongxiu,]

233
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,280
[hold on a little longer.]

234
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:41,140
[I will get you out of there.]
